# Build context is the repository root for every image (docker build -f deploy/docker/Dockerfile.<x> .)
**/.git
**/.github
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
docs
deploy/helm
deploy/k8s
deploy/grafana
deploy/compose
**/tests
**/test
**/*.md
!**/README.md
